+**`complete(id, token, result)`** commits the result and returns a receipt `{ id, outcome, token, result, completedAt, completionSeq }`; the commit is durable when it returns. `outcome` is `committed` the first time and `already-committed` for a repeat with the same token (nothing is written). Any other token throws `StaleLeaseError`; a pruned job throws `UnknownJobError`. See [RFC 007](rfc-007-exactly-once-completion.md).
